NOTE: the lengths of the 0.7500" o.d. sections have
been reduced by the lengths of the 3.3299" o.d.
sections to simulate mounting plates, which are 
6" x 8" x 0.375". These elements are medium-duty 
(83 mph).

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 9.9 dBi.
